On Thu, 14 Aug 2003, Garry Short wrote:
> Simple question - how far do I have to descend before running out of food
> stops being a problem? Any tips on how to stay alive in the meantime?
> 
> I think about 1/3 - 1/2 of my characters starve; I think most are before
