This ratio is far too high. Don't get discouraged from unhealthy side
effects when eating corpses: You just have to learn which ones are safe to
eat (in particular, they have to be fresh). Consider playing barbarians
or orcs, because they are intrinsically poison resistant. If you find that
you cannot kill enough monsters (the first level of the mines usually has
many G and h), you are spending too much time on each level:  Descend more
quickly. Try to reach Sokoban to grab the food.

And remember: If you keep the gods happy in good times, they will help you
in bad times.

